                <h4 class="seo-step-title">Download Your Verified PDF</h4>
                <p class="seo-p-small">
                  Review the confirmed final size (consistently between 94 KB and 98 KB) and click <strong>"Download PDF"</strong>. Your document is immediately ready for submission to Income Tax, EPFO, or state PSC portals.
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="seo-faq">
